WEBVTT

00:03.950 --> 00:07.980
Observing unexpected fluctuations
from the hero of the demons.

00:08.610 --> 00:12.020
Initiating excision by Last Riser.

00:12.020 --> 00:13.360
You're...?!

00:13.360 --> 00:15.280
Executing zero code.

00:16.170 --> 00:20.120
Removing Hero Vanessa's code from the world.

00:21.040 --> 00:23.660
Gloria, sequentia!

00:24.190 --> 00:27.670
Bless thy blood, body, and spirit!

00:28.650 --> 00:32.210
Don't get cocky, you trash!

00:42.370 --> 00:46.160
Rinne, you were fighting someone like her?

00:46.890 --> 00:48.060
No.

00:48.860 --> 00:49.930
I'm scared.

00:50.540 --> 00:52.510
She was always strong, but...

00:53.380 --> 00:57.410
The Vanessa from my old world
wasn't this scary!

00:57.760 --> 01:02.840
Right now, getting rid of
the weaklings before me takes priority.

01:22.790 --> 01:24.270
Kai, run!

01:24.530 --> 01:25.310
Rinne?!

01:25.310 --> 01:26.820
Shadow Prison!

01:29.040 --> 01:32.160
Run away quickly, Kai, while I hold her back!

01:32.530 --> 01:33.930
This is...

01:33.930 --> 01:36.150
the barrier of the spirit race.

01:36.840 --> 01:38.490
Hold me back, you say?

01:39.050 --> 01:42.880
Did you really think you could
trap me with such a frail barrier?

01:44.080 --> 01:45.120
Weakling!

01:54.710 --> 01:56.550
Vanessa!

01:59.110 --> 02:01.180
No... run away...

02:01.180 --> 02:03.350
You're an eyesore, human!

02:17.260 --> 02:18.450
Kai?

02:22.900 --> 02:26.990
Kai!

02:39.310 --> 02:43.850
Why Does Nobody
Remember Me in This World?

03:58.050 --> 04:03.010
Episode 4
"Thus, the World Was Recorded"

04:07.250 --> 04:08.340
Kai...

04:10.240 --> 04:12.070
He's dead.

04:12.890 --> 04:14.060
What will you do now?

04:14.570 --> 04:16.090
Will you avenge his death?

04:16.090 --> 04:18.910
Or will you try to escape on your own?

04:23.000 --> 04:25.290
You've even lost your will to—

04:27.460 --> 04:28.620
That can't be.

04:28.930 --> 04:30.990
Her wounds are healing?

04:32.040 --> 04:33.470
I'm not going to forgive you...

04:33.930 --> 04:39.630
I'm never, ever, ever,
ever going to forgive you!

04:39.980 --> 04:45.300
Vanessa!

04:48.890 --> 04:53.350
What is this chaotic appearance that seems
to mix all five races in one?

04:57.090 --> 04:58.230
Shut up.

05:01.250 --> 05:04.120
So, this is your true nature?!

05:05.720 --> 05:08.240
Shut up, shut up, shut up!

05:10.290 --> 05:12.540
Vanessa!

05:27.240 --> 05:28.640
How...

05:29.240 --> 05:31.310
How ridiculous this is!

05:32.040 --> 05:34.770
You magnificent, chaotic being!

05:37.310 --> 05:39.000
You understand, don't you?

05:39.000 --> 05:42.020
If only you had used this
form from the beginning,

05:42.020 --> 05:45.690
you could have at least let that human escape!

05:46.280 --> 05:50.200
Were you afraid to show him your true self?

05:50.850 --> 05:52.190
I understand!

05:52.190 --> 05:55.660
Humans are the weakest and most cowardly race!

05:55.660 --> 05:58.430
They fear the demons,
hate the mythical beasts,

05:58.430 --> 06:01.000
avoid the spirits, and envy the celestials.

06:01.640 --> 06:04.510
Your radiant appearance is beautiful, but...

06:05.110 --> 06:08.020
you're that much further from being human.

06:09.020 --> 06:11.000
You were afraid!

06:11.000 --> 06:13.280
Afraid to be called a monster!

06:13.850 --> 06:16.620
Are those tears of anger directed at me?

06:16.620 --> 06:18.270
No, that's not it...

06:18.270 --> 06:20.910
<i>You're</i> the one who killed that human!

06:20.910 --> 06:24.440
That human died because of your hesitation!

06:27.260 --> 06:28.460
That's right...

06:29.020 --> 06:30.680
But that doesn't matter anymore.

06:31.310 --> 06:34.070
Even if I regret it,
Kai can't be brought back to life.

06:36.210 --> 06:37.410
Vanessa...

06:38.260 --> 06:40.000
Die with me.

06:44.310 --> 06:48.260
Solitis Clar "Elmei-l-Nazyu Phenoria."

06:48.640 --> 06:49.790
A curse?!

06:53.100 --> 06:55.690
These droplets are your life itself.

06:56.670 --> 06:59.430
No defense of yours
can prevent it from happening...

06:59.430 --> 07:03.190
The droplets will continue to fall
until your life ends...

07:03.960 --> 07:05.520
along with my life!

07:05.520 --> 07:09.530
You... You abomination!

07:09.530 --> 07:11.930
This is the end for—

07:12.750 --> 07:13.200
Huh?

07:15.540 --> 07:17.190
Why... is this...?

07:18.180 --> 07:21.610
Even a curse is dependent on
how much magical power you possess.

07:21.610 --> 07:24.000
That is why you lost.

07:24.430 --> 07:26.510
This is my nest...

07:26.510 --> 07:29.800
Of course I prepared it
against invaders from the other races.

07:31.980 --> 07:32.890
Don't tell me, you...

07:33.200 --> 07:35.230
It's a wide-ranged hex.

07:35.230 --> 07:40.980
It can impede any magical spells cast by
the spirits, mythical beasts, and celestials.

07:40.980 --> 07:42.560
It's a curse circle.

07:43.030 --> 07:46.120
You, as an heir to of all the races,

07:46.120 --> 07:48.530
should be affected by the curse threefold.

07:48.910 --> 07:54.060
Come to think of it, I should even
praise you for lasting this long.

07:54.660 --> 07:56.830
How... can that be...

07:56.830 --> 07:58.700
Such a pitiful being.

07:59.290 --> 08:02.340
An irregular being, not quite
a part of any one race.

08:03.420 --> 08:07.750
Why someone like you
was even born is beyond me.

08:11.860 --> 08:14.820
I'm sorry... Kai.

08:15.530 --> 08:19.060
I'm sorry. I'm sorry.

08:19.420 --> 08:22.020
I tried my best, but...

08:22.740 --> 08:25.040
Even those words grate on my ears.

08:39.490 --> 08:41.770
What are you apologizing for, Rinne?

08:43.860 --> 08:44.980
Kai?!

08:47.110 --> 08:49.500
If you hadn't fought, I would've been a goner.

08:50.630 --> 08:53.450
I was unconscious until now after all.

08:53.960 --> 08:56.380
This isn't a dream, is it?

08:59.810 --> 09:01.390
You're warm.

09:01.860 --> 09:03.770
What did you do, human?

09:04.430 --> 09:10.110
No human can possibly survive after being hit
by my explosive magic at close range!

09:14.930 --> 09:17.070
I was saved by this thing again.

09:27.210 --> 09:30.810
You still dare to stand before me
and challenge me?

09:31.470 --> 09:32.170
That's right!

09:33.140 --> 09:34.340
Know your place, human!

09:35.190 --> 09:38.980
You're just a piece of insignificant trash
who happened to survive two of my attacks!

09:38.980 --> 09:40.320
You're just clinging to life!

09:40.320 --> 09:46.260
You crawled your way back while that
mutt was fighting me. Nothing more!

09:46.260 --> 09:50.280
That's exactly why I must defeat you
by any means necessary!

09:51.320 --> 09:54.070
Rinne risked her life fighting you.

09:54.780 --> 09:56.010
For my sake.

09:56.450 --> 10:00.100
I need to show at least that
much determination.

10:01.850 --> 10:04.000
You have some sort of plan, then?

10:04.000 --> 10:06.830
Is there something you're
going to show me as well?

10:09.470 --> 10:12.320
I know you humans very well.

10:12.730 --> 10:14.050
You're all the same.

10:14.660 --> 10:17.790
You all proclaim you'll show me
the strength of humans!

10:17.790 --> 10:21.940
The potential of humans!
The future of humans!

10:22.580 --> 10:25.600
It's all nothing but lies!

10:26.990 --> 10:29.310
The Spirit Sovereign, Rikugen Kyoko.

10:29.310 --> 10:30.960
The Lord of Heaven, Alfreya.

10:31.370 --> 10:33.280
The Fang King, Rath=IE.

10:33.820 --> 10:38.490
They're all nuisances, but they are
all leaders with absolute strength.

10:39.000 --> 10:41.570
I acknowledge them as heroes.

10:42.130 --> 10:45.040
But for you humans, there is no hero.

10:45.610 --> 10:48.800
Or are you calling yourself one?

10:50.040 --> 10:54.520
I have no desire to become humanity's hero.

10:55.010 --> 10:57.940
But you did ask to be shown, didn't you?

10:58.660 --> 11:00.040
So I'll show you.

11:01.350 --> 11:02.440
What will you show me?!

11:02.440 --> 11:06.020
The strength of humans?
The potential?! The future?!

11:06.970 --> 11:08.520
The spirit.

11:09.420 --> 11:12.390
In this world, there is no hero for humanity.

11:12.900 --> 11:17.400
Even so, I will use everything
I have to defeat you!

11:17.690 --> 11:22.490
At this very moment, as humanity's
representative, I will fight you!

11:22.860 --> 11:26.910
I can't imagine anything
you could possibly do, but...

11:29.790 --> 11:31.700
Resist all you want...

11:33.090 --> 11:35.480
until I crush everything!

11:40.100 --> 11:41.800
Devil's Planet!

11:44.610 --> 11:46.850
Answer it, Code Holder!

11:50.820 --> 11:53.650
So you can easily slice
through my magic, can you?!

11:53.960 --> 11:55.650
But I'm not finished yet!

11:55.650 --> 11:58.030
Flower of the underworld, bloom!

11:59.400 --> 12:00.360
Scatter!

12:00.670 --> 12:01.530
Now!

12:04.830 --> 12:06.470
I see...

12:07.390 --> 12:11.660
Humans don't have magic abilities,
so I can't sense them in the dark.

12:12.210 --> 12:13.290
However...

12:14.490 --> 12:15.610
You're over there!

12:23.890 --> 12:24.840
What?!

12:26.740 --> 12:30.720
I trained ten years for this very moment.

12:36.520 --> 12:39.020
Kai!

12:45.480 --> 12:48.060
Checkmate, Vanessa.

12:50.420 --> 12:52.200
It's my loss.

12:52.200 --> 12:54.370
You can have your Urza back.

12:58.000 --> 13:01.000
Why Does Nobody
Remember Me in This World?

13:01.010 --> 13:04.010
Why Does Nobody
Remember Me in This World?

13:11.870 --> 13:13.390
I'm...

13:16.590 --> 13:21.490
H-Hey, Kai.
There's something wrong with her.

13:21.490 --> 13:22.230
Yeah.

13:24.410 --> 13:29.040
Sid... Sid... That's right!

13:29.040 --> 13:31.110
Sid, the Prophet!

13:31.750 --> 13:34.390
How could I have made such a foolish error?

13:34.950 --> 13:36.110
World Reincarnation...

13:36.600 --> 13:38.630
The world will be rewritten...

13:39.290 --> 13:41.110
That's right. I remember now.

13:41.580 --> 13:42.720
That wretched Sid...

13:42.720 --> 13:45.300
So this is what he was talking about!

13:45.300 --> 13:47.550
Vanessa! What do you mean by that?!

13:47.550 --> 13:48.910
Do you know something?!

13:49.470 --> 13:51.750
The world will be recreated...

13:52.330 --> 13:55.390
Sid called this phenomenon
"World Reincarnation."

13:56.220 --> 13:59.190
Sid... knew about this?

14:00.100 --> 14:05.110
Someone caused the world
reincarnation to occur, altering the world...

14:05.780 --> 14:07.720
Find that being!

14:08.190 --> 14:13.160
It must be one of the other three heroes.

14:13.160 --> 14:16.830
Altering the world? I didn't know that was...

14:17.820 --> 14:21.670
Sid foresaw the strange occurrence
that was to happen in this world.

14:23.230 --> 14:27.230
That is why Sid had
entrusted me with his sword.

14:31.010 --> 14:36.660
In order to prepare for what's to occur,
I managed to hide that sword away.

14:36.940 --> 14:38.270
This sword?

14:38.740 --> 14:39.740
That's right.

14:40.760 --> 14:44.480
That is the one and only key to correcting
the alternation of the world.

14:45.210 --> 14:46.380
Why?

14:47.050 --> 14:49.930
Weren't you and Prophet Sid enemies?!

14:50.340 --> 14:53.100
There are records that you
fought during the Great War!

14:53.100 --> 14:57.700
That's right. I certainly did
cross blades with him.

14:58.420 --> 14:59.080
However...

14:59.930 --> 15:02.250
there are events in the past
of which you are not aware...

15:02.920 --> 15:07.050
A forbidden code, hidden away
in the world you know.

15:08.210 --> 15:10.010
A forbidden code?

15:10.730 --> 15:14.500
The zero code... It's a troublesome magic.

15:16.730 --> 15:18.350
Well done, human.

15:19.270 --> 15:21.540
Your clever planning to utilize the darkness.

15:21.540 --> 15:24.250
Your courage to let go of your ultimate weapon.

15:24.250 --> 15:26.010
Your honed combat skills.

15:26.700 --> 15:30.160
So this is... the human spirit.

15:33.490 --> 15:36.160
Oh, darn it! I'm so frustrated!

15:37.330 --> 15:39.690
I lost big time, here!

15:39.690 --> 15:41.620
I can't even make excuses for it.

15:42.380 --> 15:43.720
You'd better prepare yourself.

15:44.280 --> 15:45.720
If we meet again,

15:45.720 --> 15:48.580
this time I'll face you as a succubus instead.

15:50.390 --> 15:53.640
I'll love you so hard, it'll bring you to tears.

15:55.240 --> 16:00.260
Next time... let's have more fun...

16:02.110 --> 16:03.670
Vanessa...

16:06.250 --> 16:07.190
Kai?!

16:08.730 --> 16:10.180
It's over.

16:10.180 --> 16:11.020
Yeah!

16:12.410 --> 16:16.870
We beat... the hero of the demons.

16:16.870 --> 16:19.790
Yeah! You won, Kai!

16:26.780 --> 16:28.500
Urza Federation to all nations!

16:28.770 --> 16:32.560
The Urza Rebel Army, commanded by the
Knight of the Sacred Light, Jeanne E Anise,

16:32.560 --> 16:35.010
has successfully retaken
the royal capital, Urzak,

16:35.010 --> 16:38.070
and defeated the hero of the demons!

16:37.480 --> 16:38.430
All right!

16:38.430 --> 16:39.390
Hooray!

16:53.030 --> 16:54.980
Kai, are you okay?

16:54.980 --> 16:56.910
Yeah, no problems.

16:57.660 --> 17:01.160
It's just... there's something
we need to figure out now.

17:01.780 --> 17:02.740
Yeah.

17:04.740 --> 17:08.920
I thought something had
happened to the two of us.

17:09.710 --> 17:14.550
But if we're to believe Vanessa's words...
it's the opposite.

17:15.270 --> 17:18.890
Something happened, and we
were the only ones unaffected.

17:21.140 --> 17:23.270
I want things to go back
to the way they were.

17:23.960 --> 17:26.950
This world is kind of scary.

17:27.600 --> 17:28.700
Agreed.

17:30.380 --> 17:31.820
Kai, Rinne.

17:33.500 --> 17:35.850
The world up here might
not be much to look at,

17:35.850 --> 17:39.620
but it's thanks to you two
that we're able to be here at all.

17:40.200 --> 17:41.200
Thank you.

17:41.610 --> 17:43.940
On behalf of the Rebel Army,
we give our thanks.

17:44.420 --> 17:48.430
Still... you don't seem very happy about it.

17:49.660 --> 17:51.800
No, we're relieved.

17:52.210 --> 17:56.080
I don't think I could beat
Vanessa if I ran into her again.

17:57.550 --> 18:01.470
Kai, Rinne...
Because you took back this area,

18:01.470 --> 18:04.170
humans will be able to do more in the world.

18:05.330 --> 18:07.380
We'll rebuild the city to how it was...

18:08.070 --> 18:12.230
No, even better than it was 30 years ago.

18:12.230 --> 18:13.230
Yeah.

18:13.960 --> 18:17.520
But I believe that can be done
by someone other than me.

18:17.520 --> 18:18.280
Huh?

18:18.890 --> 18:22.140
I'll leave the reconstruction
of the royal capital to the executives.

18:22.140 --> 18:24.690
Those who knew
the royal capital 30 years ago

18:24.690 --> 18:29.170
will be more enthusiastic about its
recovery than a youngster like me.

18:29.800 --> 18:31.880
So it doesn't have to be me.

18:32.180 --> 18:33.260
Then...

18:33.260 --> 18:34.760
What are you going to do, Jeannie?

18:34.760 --> 18:35.760
It's Jeanne.

18:36.350 --> 18:39.410
Jeannie, are you done because
you drove away all the demons?

18:39.410 --> 18:42.080
No. I'll be setting sail.

18:43.510 --> 18:45.600
I'll be leaving Urza.

18:46.770 --> 18:50.200
There are three major federations
that were conquered.

18:50.740 --> 18:54.140
Io Federation to the east,
Yulun Federation to the south,

18:54.140 --> 18:55.630
and Schulz Federation to the west.

18:56.030 --> 19:01.330
One has been taken over by the celestials, one
by the spirits, and one by the mythical beasts,

19:01.330 --> 19:05.660
and there is a rebel group
fighting against each occupying force.

19:06.250 --> 19:11.220
I will be working with the other rebel
groups to deploy a large-scale operation.

19:11.220 --> 19:14.920
There's already talk of forming
a united front from several rebel groups.

19:15.560 --> 19:17.960
The news of the hero of the demons' defeat

19:17.960 --> 19:19.990
has lit a fire under the world at large.

19:20.630 --> 19:22.660
That is why I would like you to come with us.

19:23.320 --> 19:27.610
We might be able to pull off
the same thing your world did.

19:28.710 --> 19:30.280
I will take command.

19:30.910 --> 19:35.030
I'll lead my soldiers so that
you guys will have the utmost support.

19:35.450 --> 19:38.740
I will become the greatest
commander in order to do so.

19:39.560 --> 19:42.200
That is why I would like you
to fight alongside us.

19:43.190 --> 19:45.380
Let's finish the Great War of the Five Races.

19:48.120 --> 19:52.300
O-Of course, I'll ensure that
you're properly compensated...

19:52.300 --> 19:53.280
For example...

19:53.280 --> 19:55.710
No, that's not it. It's not that I don't want to.

19:56.330 --> 20:00.090
I was just a bit seriously surprised.
You're amazing, Jeanne.

20:00.400 --> 20:01.370
Huh?

20:01.370 --> 20:06.190
The Jeanne I knew had ambitions,
but also had more of a childish side to her.

20:06.190 --> 20:09.130
What?! What part of me is childish?!

20:09.130 --> 20:11.970
Well, she'd contact me
during my training sessions

20:11.970 --> 20:15.250
to speak of personal matters through
our official communicators, and...

20:15.250 --> 20:15.730
What?!

20:16.490 --> 20:19.720
She'd ponder about what presents
to get her friends,

20:19.720 --> 20:22.770
and she would worry about her future.

20:22.770 --> 20:24.190
I did all that?

20:24.190 --> 20:27.870
I really can't believe there was such a world.

20:29.800 --> 20:32.090
I'll tell you about it one day if you like.

20:38.770 --> 20:42.520
Jeanne, if you want to take this
fight to the world,

20:42.520 --> 20:44.440
I'd be glad to have you at my back.

20:44.850 --> 20:47.270
I was actually going to ask
you if you'd come...

20:47.660 --> 20:52.100
If you'd give us your support to fight
the three remaining heroes.

20:52.500 --> 20:53.600
Then...

20:55.590 --> 20:56.750
We'll cooperate.

20:57.270 --> 20:59.270
Let's end this Great War
of the Five Races together.

21:00.700 --> 21:01.560
Yes!

21:06.120 --> 21:09.690
I'm in, too!
'Cause I want to be with Kai!

21:11.000 --> 21:13.690
Yeah. Thank you, Rinne.

21:17.080 --> 21:19.500
My fellow soldiers! Were you able to rest?

21:19.800 --> 21:21.950
Yes! Maybe a little too much!

21:21.950 --> 21:25.020
I actually feel like I'm still dreaming.

21:27.890 --> 21:29.550
This is undeniably real!

21:30.300 --> 21:32.460
We've recaptured the royal city!

21:32.460 --> 21:33.810
Yeah!

21:34.060 --> 21:36.060
It's going to get busy around here.

21:36.060 --> 21:37.950
We'll immediately hold a strategy meeting!

21:37.950 --> 21:40.100
Everyone prepare right away!

21:38.890 --> 21:39.830
Rinne.

21:39.830 --> 21:40.730
Yeah?

21:40.100 --> 21:41.070
Don't be late!

21:41.070 --> 21:41.950
Yes, sir!

21:42.200 --> 21:44.600
I'm going to end the
Great War of the Five Races.

21:45.210 --> 21:49.780
If there's no Sid here,
I'll have to do it myself...

21:50.450 --> 21:56.750
Then find out who's behind the world
reincarnation, and set the world right.

21:58.980 --> 21:59.750
Let's go.

21:59.750 --> 22:01.650
Y-Yeah!

22:05.380 --> 22:07.540
Watch me, Sid!

23:36.560 --> 23:40.020
Why Does Nobody
Remember Me in This World?
